      {
        "introduction": "It is not long before Jeremiah discloses that he is not merely an instrument through whom God mechanically speaks. Jeremiah has his own feelings, doubts, and questions. He now records the first of many conversations he will have with God throughout his ministry. This one reveals Jeremiah's concern for his hearers."
